@dsh-tui-vendor/mathjax-tex-svg

This package is a bundle built from third-party sources for dsh-tui's LaTeX
math image renderer. `lib/index.mjs` is generated by `build.mjs` (esbuild)
from `src/entry.mjs`; it contains only the parts of the sources below that
TeX-to-SVG conversion reaches: the TeX input jax (every TeX extension except
`noerrors`, `noundefined` and `html`), the SVG output jax with its TeX font data, and
the lite DOM adaptor. No source file was modified; the bundle is minified.
`lib/index.mjs.LEGAL.txt` keeps the license comments found in the bundled
sources, and `lib/bundled-packages.json` lists the packages it contains.

